*** REPLACE THIS SPOILER WITH YOUR FLAME ***

If you get hit by a nurse while wielding no weapon and wearing
no armor, your hit points increase.  Problems:

- after about 40 or 50 hits, they get bored and teleport away.
- if another monster comes up you are in trouble.

One game I had a lot of food, a teleport control ring, and a
scare monster scroll.  This combination made nurse hunting
very effective.  In general, though, this feature is a deadly
temptation (kinda like wielding dead c's).

